  "critical_business_rules": [
    "Sales does not own stock.",
    "Sales must request stock changes through Inventory services.",
    "Stock must be revalidated at invoice posting inside the transaction.",
    "Invoice calculations are server authoritative.",
    "Posted invoices are not casually edited; corrections use controlled reversal/correction workflows.",
    "Sales Return restores stock through Inventory services.",
    "Payment is separate from the invoice.",
    "Duplicate posting must be harmless and idempotent."
